'50,150' for $50-$150). Do NOT infer a price range if the user did not mention one.","type":"string"},"size":{"description":"Page size for results","type":"integer","format":"int32"},"eventKeyword":{"description":"Event or show name (e.g., 'Eras Tour', 'Hamilton'). When populated, search goes directly to event search with this keyword.","type":"string"},"attractionId":{"description":"Attraction id for a specific ticketmaster attraction/artist/team. When populated, search routes through attraction search by ID, then fetches events.","type":"string"},"selection":{"description":"Ticket inventory type: 'resale' for events with source='TMR', 'any' for all other sources. Auto-detected if omitted.","type":"string"},"venueKeyword":{"description":"Venue name (e.g., 'Madison Square Garden', 'Staples Center'). When populated, search routes through venue search first, then fetches events.","type":"string"},"startDateTime":{"description":"Start date/time filter in ISO 8601 format. Must be a future date.","type":"string"},"venueId":{"description":"Venue id for a specific ticketmaster venue When populated, search goes directly to event search with this keyword.","type":"string"},"attractionKeyword":{"description":"Artist, performer, or team name (e.g., 'Taylor Swift', 'Lakers'). When populated, search routes through attraction search first, then fetches events.","type":"string"},"quantity":{"description":"Number of tickets wanted (e.g., 2 for a pair). Only set if user explicitly states how many.","type":"integer","format":"int32"},"unsupportedFilter":{"description":"Short description of any unsupported filter the user requested (e.g., 'in the shade', 'ADA accessible'). Only set when request exceeds supported filters (section, price, sort, quantity).","type":"string"},"endDateTime":{"description":"End date/time filter in ISO 8601 format. Must be a future date.","type":"string"},"location":{"allOf":[{"description":"Location details for geolocation-based search","properties":{"radius